-- refusal
type: Neemle.Orm.Lite.CapabilityNotSupportedException
message: provider 'no-capability' does not support JsonDocument, which order by a moved numeric field with an epoch-milliseconds fallback requires (table 'corpus_notes'). no-capability has no JSON document type, so it cannot order by a moved numeric field with an epoch-milliseconds fallback; a statement emitted anyway would carry PostgreSQL syntax to a server that cannot parse it.
